flowchart TD
    A([User Query]) --> B[JWT Auth<br/>tenant_id · role]
    B --> C[RBAC<br/>get_allowed_classifications]
    C --> D[Prompt Security Check<br/>keyword · pattern · heuristic]
    D -->|injection detected| E([Return warning<br/>no retrieval])
    D -->|safe| F[Embed Query<br/>all-MiniLM-L6-v2 · dim=384]

    F --> G{Hybrid Retrieval}

    subgraph retrieval [Retrieval Layer]
        H[Qdrant Vector Search<br/>filter: tenant_id + classification]
        I[PostgreSQL FTS<br/>to_tsvector · plainto_tsquery]
        J[RRF Merge<br/>Reciprocal Rank Fusion]
    end

    G --> H
    G --> I
    H --> J
    I --> J

    J --> K{Reranking<br/>enabled?}
    K -->|yes| L[CrossEncoder<br/>ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2]
    K -->|no| M
    L --> M[Prompt Assembly<br/>system + context chunks + question]

    M --> N[Model Router<br/>restricted → Ollama<br/>else → vLLM or Ollama]
    N --> O[LLM Inference<br/>streaming SSE or batch]
    O --> P[Response + Source Citations]
    P --> Q[Audit Log<br/>rag.query · tenant_id · latency_ms]
    Q --> R([Return to User])
